# Story 62: Approve Always & Reject With Reason (45s)
# Hook: Approve once and forever, or reject with a reason the agent can learn from.
# Duration: 45s
# Source: story-062-approve-always-reject-reason.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 6

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
Approve once and forever, or reject with a reason the agent can learn from.

[00:03.0 --> 00:08.0]
Start rysh and switch into prompt mode to talk to the agent.

[00:08.0 --> 00:16.0]
Ask the agent to create a file. file_write is a gated tool, so an approval prompt appears in the footer.

[00:16.0 --> 00:26.0]
Press capital Y to approve always. Rysh remembers this decision so the same kind of action won't ask again.

[00:26.0 --> 00:38.0]
Now ask for something risky. Press capital N to reject with a reason -- type why, and the agent adapts.

[00:38.0 --> 00:45.0]
y approves, capital Y always approves, n rejects, capital N rejects with a reason, and Escape rejects silently.

